XXX No /proc filesystem nor a way to get a path back from a fd on OpenBSD.
Set the GError before returning NULL: all callers (open-uri.c, trash.c,
wallpaper.c, email.c) dereference error->message when this returns NULL.

Index: src/xdp-app-info.c
--- src/xdp-app-info.c.orig
+++ src/xdp-app-info.c
@@ -512,6 +512,12 @@ xdp_app_info_get_path_for_fd (XdpAppInfo
